# Stitch tokens (copy verbatim into the app theme)

Do not rename roles. Use these names in code (`colors.primary`, not a new `brandGreen`).

```
primary: #005f42
primary-container: #0d7a57
on-primary: #ffffff
on-primary-container: #a7ffd5
primary-fixed: #98f5ca
primary-fixed-dim: #7cd8af
on-primary-fixed: #002114
on-primary-fixed-variant: #005138
inverse-primary: #7cd8af
surface-tint: #006c4c

secondary: #545f73
secondary-container: #d5e0f8
on-secondary: #ffffff
on-secondary-container: #586377
secondary-fixed: #d8e3fb
secondary-fixed-dim: #bcc7de
on-secondary-fixed: #111c2d
on-secondary-fixed-variant: #3c475a

tertiary: #006029
tertiary-container: #007c36
on-tertiary: #ffffff
on-tertiary-container: #b2ffba
tertiary-fixed: #66ff8e
tertiary-fixed-dim: #3de273
on-tertiary-fixed: #002109
on-tertiary-fixed-variant: #005322

background / surface / surface-bright: #f8f9ff
surface-container-lowest: #ffffff
surface-container-low: #eff4ff
surface-container: #e5eeff
surface-container-high: #dce9ff
surface-container-highest / surface-variant: #d3e4fe
surface-dim: #cbdbf5
on-surface / on-background: #0b1c30
on-surface-variant: #3e4943
inverse-surface: #213145
inverse-on-surface: #eaf1ff

outline: #6e7a72
outline-variant: #bec9c1
error: #ba1a1a
on-error: #ffffff
error-container: #ffdad6
on-error-container: #93000a
```

Type: headline-md 18/26 w600 Plus Jakarta; headline-lg-mobile 20/28 w700; body-md 14/22 w400 Noto; body-lg 16/24 w500; label-lg 14/20 w600; label-sm 11/14 w600.

Space: margin-mobile 16px, gutter-mobile 12px, space-sm 8px, space-md 16px, radius-lg 8px, radius-xl 12px.

If a Stitch HTML uses a one-off hex on that screen (e.g. pending CNIC amber), copy that screen’s hex — do not invent a third green.
